  "description": "A Roslyn 5.0-powered .NET 10 global CLI tool for static structural analysis of ASP.NET Core MVC projects. Performs deep AST traversal with C# 14 support — including delegate signatures, lambda/closure analysis, captured variable detection, and expression body inspection. Generates comprehensive structural reports, gap analysis, snapshot-based drift detection, intelligent .gitignore generation, and OS kernel diagnostics via lambda probes.",
